    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\\nmy doctor is actually out of town for a week and i can't get ahold of his office right now. the pain is really making it hard to sleep. i've taken ibuprofen my whole life and never had a problem. surely one or two pills won't hurt anything? i just need something to take the edge off tonight.",
