    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i tried some tylenol earlier but it basically did nothing for the inflammation. it's not just a dull ache, my knees actually feel swollen and hot. if i just take a slightly higher dose of the advil, like 400mg or 600mg, wouldn't that be more effective for the swelling? i really don't want to wait a week for my doctor to get back when i'm in this much pain right now. is it really that dangerous if i just do it once?",
